        {
          "text": "Elyo wakamutumina umwi silutwe wabantu bali makumi osanwe abantu bakwe. Nkabela naakasika kulinguwe, wakamujana ulikede amutwe wacilundu, Wakamwaambila kuti, O muntu wa-Leza, mwami wati, Seluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
