        {
          "text": "Alimwi mwami wakamutumina umbi silutwe abantu bakwe bali makumi osanwe. Alakwe wakatanta acilundu nkwaakabede, wakati, O muntu wa-Leza, mwami wati, Fwambaana kuseluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.11",
