        {
          "text": "Alimwi mwami wakatuma silutwe aumwi watatu abantu bakwe bali makumi osanwe. Nkabela oyo silutwe watatu wakatanta nkwaakabede Eliya, wamufugamina, wamukumbilisya kuti, Akaka muntu wa-Leza! Buumi bwangu buyandike mumeso aako, abwalo buumi bwabaaba balanda bako bali makumi osanwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
