        {
          "text": "Aboobo wakafwa mbubonya mbuli ijwi Eliya ndyaakaamba, nkabela Joramu munyina wakalya izina lyakwe mumwaka wabili wa-Joramu mwana wa-Josafati mwami wa-Juda, nkaambo katajisi mwana. ",
          "type": "text",
